{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the leader of a state in a complex and ever-changing world. Every decision you make affects the support of key factions: bureaucrats, capitalists, workers, the military, and others. Monitor the economy, ecology, corruption, crime, and public health. Shape domestic policies and build international relations - from peaceful alliances to cold-blooded confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implement reforms, invest in critical sectors, tackle crises, and use diplomatic moves to maintain the nation\u2019s stability. But remember: every choice has consequences, and losing the support of even one powerful group could cost you your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance the interests of multiple factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several forms of government affecting gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economic, social, and political management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements of diplomacy and international relations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices with long-term consequences.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944850?t=1762277650","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944850?t=1762277650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944850/ff3c989443bb1553a14c4caa71959d035ac9e938/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762277650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944850/ff3c989443bb1553a14c4caa71959d035ac9e938/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762277650","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the leader of a state in a complex and ever-changing world. Every decision you make affects the support of key factions: bureaucrats, capitalists, workers, the military, and others. Monitor the economy, ecology, corruption, crime, and public health. Shape domestic policies and build international relations - from peaceful alliances to cold-blooded confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implement reforms, invest in critical sectors, tackle crises, and use diplomatic moves to maintain the nation\u2019s stability. But remember: every choice has consequences, and losing the support of even one powerful group could cost you your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance the interests of multiple factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several forms of government affecting gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economic, social, and political management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements of diplomacy and international relations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices with long-term consequences.</p>","developers":["W-I-W"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944850/ce6ac867610287378152f3d537b0d4d66ebfabb5/header.jpg?t=1762277650","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3944850/1562855863/7182bd64717ebd0187df7f86bf80992d1423042a/1755798653/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757058537","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3944850/1562855863/7182bd64717ebd0187df7f86bf80992d1423042a/1755798653/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757058537","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3944850/1562855863/7182bd64717ebd0187df7f86bf80992d1423042a/1755798653/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757058537","id":257186785,"name":"Main","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257186785/5e340d1a885125332bd9